### 1. Backend – `clubController.js`

#### [MODIFY] [clubController.js](file:///c:/Users/ankit/OneDrive/Desktop/CampusConnect-2/server/controllers/clubController.js)

**Bug #1 – Admin should not be able to join their own club:**
```js
// joinClub – add at top of handler
if (club.adminId.toString() === req.user.id) {
  return res.status(400).json({ success: false, message: "Club admin cannot join their own club" });
}
```

**Bug #3 – approveMember / rejectMember must verify *club-specific* admin:**
The route has `authorize("clubAdmin","orgAdmin")` which only checks role, NOT whether this person is the admin of *this specific club*. The controller checks it correctly, but the route middleware passes ANY clubAdmin through, which is misleading. The controller fix is already present — add a comment clarifying this.

**Bug #8 – Admin should not be able to leave their own club:**
```js
// leaveClub – add at top of handler
if (club.adminId.toString() === req.user.id) {
  return res.status(400).json({ success: false, message: "Club admin cannot leave their own club" });
}
```

