### 2. Backend – `eventController.js`

#### [MODIFY] [eventController.js](file:///c:/Users/ankit/OneDrive/Desktop/CampusConnect-2/server/controllers/eventController.js)

**Bug #2 – Block RSVP on cancelled/completed events and past dates:**
```js
// rsvpEvent – add after the event fetch
