### 3. Backend – `Event.js` model

#### [MODIFY] [Event.js](file:///c:/Users/ankit/OneDrive/Desktop/CampusConnect-2/server/models/Event.js)

**Bug #9 – Date validator fires on updates too, breaking status edits:**
Mongoose validators run on `save()`. The `date > new Date()` validator will fail when updating old events. We must use `this.isNew` to skip on updates.

```js
validate: {
  validator: function (v) {
    // Only validate for NEW documents — editing existing events
    // (e.g. marking as "completed") should not re-validate the past date
    return this.isNew ? v > new Date() : true;
  },
  message: "Event date must be in the future",
},
```

