### 9. Frontend – Admin Route Guards

#### [MODIFY] [App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ankit/OneDrive/Desktop/CampusConnect-2/client/src/App.jsx)
#### [MODIFY] [ProtectedRoute.jsx](file:///c:/Users/ankit/OneDrive/Desktop/CampusConnect-2/client/src/routes/ProtectedRoute.jsx)

**Bug #10 – Admin routes not guarded at route level:**
Create an `AdminRoute` wrapper (similar to `ProtectedRoute`) that additionally checks `orgAdmin` role. Wrap `/admin/*` routes with it.

```jsx
// New: AdminRoute.jsx
export default function AdminRoute({ children }) {
  const { user, loading } = useAuth();
  if (loading) return <p>Loading...</p>;
  if (!user) return <Navigate to="/login" />;
  if (!user.roles?.includes("orgAdmin")) return <Navigate to="/dashboard" />;
  return children;
}
```

