## Verification Plan

### Backend
- Start server and manually test each endpoint with curl or Postman:
  - `POST /clubs/:id/join` as admin → expect 400
  - `POST /clubs/:id/leave` as admin → expect 400
  - `POST /events/:id/rsvp` with cancelled/completed event → expect 400
  - `POST /auth/refresh` with token of deleted user → expect 401
  - `PUT /events/:id` with past date to update status → should succeed

### Frontend
- Navigate to a club you admin → no "Request to Join" button visible
- Navigate to EventDetail as event creator → Edit/Delete button visible
- Open `/admin` as a non-orgAdmin → redirect to `/dashboard`
- CreateEvent page: club dropdown only shows clubs you admin
